# Reach the Corn tutorial, then DO NOTHING. The control arm.
#
# Pairs with moving.pad, which is this file plus a held stick. The two are
# identical up to t=47 on purpose: same boot, same loads, same scene, same
# binary, so the only difference between the two runs is whether the player is
# moving. That is what separates "rendering contention while the camera moves"
# from "the music feed is late regardless".
#
# Nothing after t=47. Past the title START is PAUSE, and an A after it is
# navigating a pause menu, so a schedule that keeps pressing puts the two arms
# in two different places and the comparison is void.
#
# A run that does not reach live=61 is discarded, not compared. Roughly one in
# four does not.

12.0:START  13.5:START  15.0:A
20.0:START  21.5:START  23.0:A
28.0:START  29.5:START  31.0:A
36.0:START  37.5:START  39.0:A
44.0:START  45.5:START  47.0:A
